#. 本当にあるのですか？
msgctxt "0001 | CELES"
msgid "Is it really possible?"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲さんが
#. 男子更衣室に入る方法が…
msgctxt "0002 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Could Chihiro really have gotten\n"
"into the boys locker room somehow?"
msgstr ""

#. あ！　僕にはわかったぞ！
msgctxt "0003 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Ah! I've got it!"
msgstr ""

#. 彼女は<CLT 9>電子生徒手帳を
#. 改造した<CLT>のだ！
msgctxt "0004 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"She must have\n"
"<CLT 9>hacked her e-Handbook<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 彼女は超高校級の
#. プログラマー…
msgctxt "0005 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"She was the Ultimate Programmer,\n"
"after all."
msgstr ""

#. それくらいは
#. 出来たはずだぞッ！！
msgctxt "0006 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"I'm sure that would've\n"
"been no problem for her!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そうじゃねーって…
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "No, I don't think that's it..."
msgstr ""

#. あいつは玄関ホールの
#. アレを使ったんだ。
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"She used the thing\n"
"that was in the main hall!"
msgstr ""

#. へ？　アレとは？
msgctxt "0009 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Huh? What thing?"
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、
#. <CLT 9>桑田っちの電子生徒手帳<CLT>だべ！
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I'm talkin' about <CLT 9>Leon's handbook<CLT>,\n"
"of course!"
msgstr ""

#. あれを使えば男子更衣室に
#. 入れるはずだって！
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"If she had that, she could get into\n"
"the boys locker room no problem!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>きっとあるはず…<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's gotta be it...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>その手があったか！<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>I never thought of that!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>いくらなんでも…<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>No matter what...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>アレって？<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>What thing?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>アレ？　ゲラゲラゲラ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Huh? Kyeehahaha!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>アレって何だろ？<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>I wonder what it is...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>なんと！<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>What!?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>え…でもそれってさ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Huh? But that's...<CLT>"
msgstr ""
